    <p style="font-size:17px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);max-width:700px;margin:0 auto;line-height:1.6;">Modern suspended ceilings that hide services, improve acoustics, and give your Edinburgh office or retail space a clean, professional finish. Armstrong, Rockfon, and Ecophon systems.</p>
  </div>
